    <p>Troop 13 has been in these woods before you. They run a tight operation: quarterly memos, specification sheets, a lot of cookie money, and field sites nobody is supposed to find.</p>
    <p>Your scouts keep finding their paperwork, scattered across every map. Collect it, pin it to the Evidence Board, and start putting together what Troop 13 has been doing to the animals.</p>
